<title>UK: Lloyd's agency updates syndicate recommendations.</title>
<headline>Lloyd's agency updates syndicate recommendations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lloyds of London members agency LRG Cater Allen has updated its preliminary recommendations for each syndicate on which it has a participation for 1996.</p>
<p>LRG said in a statement that it will comment on all syndicates trading for 1997 when it issues its full SyndicateCommentaries Book later this month.</p>
